# Per-profile website blocking (associations only)
# Format: profile_name|rule_name
#
# Rules are defined in /etc/config/block_rules (reusable domain lists).
# Profile names must match /etc/config/parental_profiles.
#
# Cron example:
#   0 20 * * * website-blocking.sh enable eli no_streaming
#   0 8 * * * website-blocking.sh disable eli no_streaming

eli|no_streaming
eli|no_gaming
ishan|no_streaming
ishan|no_gaming
tia|no_streaming